<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_30936679-209e-4fa0-a834-27e054e4d113"
id="sec.3-def.approvedregionalinfrastructureproject"><b><i>approved regional
infrastructure project</i></b></defterm> means a nominated regional
infrastructure project approved by the Treasurer under section
6.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_46c8e456-5f14-4980-8d53-1c5f0ece0114"
id="sec.3-def.function"><b><i>function</i></b></defterm> includes a power,
authority or duty, and <defterm type="definition"
guid="_3cc04271-ab3e-41ea-b43b-df61865b0521"
id="sec.3-def.exercise"><b><i>exercise</i></b></defterm> a function includes
perform a duty.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c575e6d6-f0a5-40a7-bb90-3c807217744d"
id="sec.3-def.funding"><b><i>funding</i></b></defterm>, in relation to a
project, includes a reference to funding the planning, selection,
implementation and delivery of the project.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_6142abc5-207a-4384-88ab-43254a2eba2b"
id="sec.3-def.GSFagency"><b><i>GSF agency</i></b></defterm> has the same
meaning as in the <legref refid="act-2018-055" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Finance Act
2018</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_90fd9c5e-4c2a-418a-b87a-246b70684f36"
id="sec.3-def.nominatedregionalinfrastructureproject"><b><i>nominated regional
infrastructure project</i></b></defterm> means an infrastructure project
jointly nominated by the Premier and the Minister for Regional New South Wales
under section 5.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_f52005a3-ef08-4db2-b66c-198634e7ec84"
id="sec.3-def.PublicServiceagency"><b><i>Public Service
agency</i></b></defterm> means a Public Service agency within the meaning of
the <legref refid="act-2013-040" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Employment Act
2013</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c6cc4b36-b9f4-4bce-b33d-f979779d3416"
id="sec.3-def.regionalNewSouthWales"><b><i>regional New South
Wales</i></b></defterm> means any part of New South Wales that is outside the
metropolitan areas of Sydney, Newcastle and Wollongong.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_501cf53d-178d-4767-b940-645f85eaff20" id="sec.3-def.theFund"><b><i>the
Fund</i></b></defterm> means the Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund established under
section 7.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_b16405be-c1a9-4440-ab96-570c388c4773"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_c1a2ab9a-fd2f-4277-a9dd-36132d2d3550"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref refid="act-1987-015" jurisd="NSW"
