<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_377c4db3-e322-412b-b667-fa58d5f9d0f4"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Object of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The object of this Act is to enable the use of
the value of the proceeds of the sale by the State of its interest in Snowy
Hydro Limited for infrastructure projects of primary benefit to regional New
South Wales.</txt></block></level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_034bcb6d-910a-4bac-98ad-fba323bbe511"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_10ce410d-0b5b-40b4-b69d-9e2f0a2d245f"
id="pt.2-he"><b>Projects to be funded</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d583ee12-0fdc-4da8-b02c-da232c9dab46"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_f58fcb0c-474b-4ad9-b962-98d936146d7d"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Premier and Minister for Regional New South Wales may jointly
nominate infrastructure projects</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_be789697-de19-4a8e-aa96-76e144d1f43d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Premier and Minister for Regional New South
Wales may jointly nominate infrastructure projects for funding under this
Act.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_18286b22-e597-406c-bf91-d23abca9a9a7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Premier and Minister for Regional New South
Wales may jointly nominate an infrastructure project if they consider that the
project will improve economic development in regional New South Wales and will
primarily benefit regional New South Wales.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5bd4995c-f5ab-4fd8-b224-932b9cc6d586"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A project that is part of a larger infrastructure
project may be nominated if that part meets the criteria for
nomination.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7d8c2c04-7222-44ee-b6ae-d202a687f7dd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Premier or Minister for Regional New South
Wales is to notify the Treasurer in writing of any joint nomination of a
project.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 2024 No 47,
Sch 1.22.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0de7c169-0614-4cdd-b0cf-012be2b7eb75"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f4debb1a-6f9d-4a83-b069-93d9533a38ea"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Treasurer to approve funding</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c5174fa7-a88f-4670-ba96-3c9097d1ccb6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An infrastructure project jointly nominated by
the Premier and Minister for Regional New South Wales is not eligible for
funding under this Act unless it is approved by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_65b2d761-2d4b-406e-a0fa-9b3d49b669b9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In determining whether to approve funding under
this Act for a nominated regional infrastructure project, the Treasurer is to
take into account whether funding the project under this Act is consistent
with the purpose of the Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12d77b3a-cdce-4e0e-a485-ffbf3f12fb93"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subsection (2) does not limit the matters that
the Treasurer may take into account in determining whether to approve funding
under this Act for a nominated regional infrastructure
project.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 2024 No 47,
Sch 1.22.</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_86d92450-fdb7-4da9-ac97-8e7d16f331bd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 3</b></no><heading guid="_e5000047-82df-461b-b9ad-f540c8d3ec4d"
id="pt.3-he"><b>Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_335f5b5a-5093-44ec-8a9f-bf68ba1f6cbf"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_b6a0a2c4-3a05-4b33-ad07-2ca0fa7624eb"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Establishment of Snowy Hydro Legacy
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund is to be established in
the Special Deposits Account.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_77d02106-711b-4181-b76d-029647528db7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_1e76bd2f-cfbf-48e2-b3d0-02ef9674df23"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Purpose of Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fac68ede-03e8-4b41-996b-5b5e8e6efc0f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The purpose of the Fund is to improve economic
development in regional New South Wales and, for that purpose, to fund
infrastructure projects that primarily benefit regional New South
Wales.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_161f554e-1825-4084-9482-f29ee945ecaa"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">It is the intention of Parliament that the total
payments from the Fund for approved regional infrastructure projects will be
equivalent to the value of the proceeds of the sale by the State of its
interest in Snowy Hydro Limited to the Commonwealth.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_064d6898-ffae-4a04-9341-dd92c2614e80"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_06efbd28-1d59-49cc-bc6b-f1effded297f"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Payments into Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5b4459c2-f3ec-411c-8530-acb2f20a8933"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is payable into the Fund the
following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ea4f25ed-79f7-41e5-9e17-374184b562ec" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament or advanced
by the Treasurer for the purposes of the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d62b2f51-1aa8-4f7b-88bf-2b69c86f4c7d" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament for services
that is used for the purpose of funding an approved regional infrastructure
project,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6b205cd0-2b77-4db3-84dc-7033831c12ae" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money appropriated by Parliament to the
Treasurer for the general purposes of the Government (and not for the purposes
of individual GSF agencies) and directed by the Treasurer to be paid into the
Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0569a5aa-7ee7-481a-9d97-8df5e66275e3" id="sec.9-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all money directed or authorised to be paid into
the Fund by or under this or any other Act or law.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fc0c5f62-2457-4738-95eb-2250a59c018b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">To avoid doubt, money appropriated by Parliament
before the commencement of this section may be paid into the
Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_23ea1fdf-05f6-458f-acaf-d54baa278f66"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Money paid into the Fund under subsection (1) (b)
is taken to have been appropriated out of the Consolidated Fund for the
purposes of the Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 9:</b> Am 2018 No 38,
sec 16 (2).</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2d0c885a-bd8b-47c7-90af-2cc377fec402"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_85d4969a-895c-4cdc-bc30-69a45c6ca58b"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Payments from Snowy Hydro Legacy Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is payable from the Fund the
following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a5bf87b9-7d05-4e1b-9ef3-eea29fe7bbc3" id="sec.10-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money required to fund all or any part of the
cost of an approved regional infrastructure project,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_37f2ff16-5b39-490e-8d84-568b906db2ba" id="sec.10-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money required to meet administrative
expenses related to the Fund,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_88ff5bda-296c-4920-9b22-db58cac657f4" id="sec.10-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any money directed or authorised to be paid from
the Fund by or under this or any other Act or law.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.11">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4f5e4f15-13fa-4198-b6d0-3330a4ebdef0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.11"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>11</no><heading guid="_7fc7fa4f-2331-45c6-a90b-a701e950a4d7"
id="sec.11-he"><b>Investment of money in Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer may invest money in the
Fund&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_47f5924b-382a-4eed-b65b-1887cd0264a4" id="sec.11-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister administering this Act is a GSF
agency for the purposes of Part 6 of the <legref refid="act-2018-055"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government
Sector Finance Act 2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way that the Minister
administering this Act is permitted to invest money under that Part,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_25677c65-170f-4347-ad09-ae6c522b388f" id="sec.11-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">if the Minister administering this Act is not a
GSF agency for the purposes of Part 6 of the <legref refid="act-2018-055"
jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Government
Sector Finance Act 2018</i></name></legref>&#8212;in any way approved by the
Treasurer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 11:</b> Subst 2018 No
38, sec 16 (3).</txt></content>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="pt.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5733380c-edc7-4c27-a3ce-692f451b0d6b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="pt.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 4</b></no><heading guid="_c1cf5dfc-527b-4157-a168-a749c32bc8dd"
id="pt.4-he"><b>Miscellaneous</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sec.12">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_83ddcde3-f689-4fe8-a8b5-2fc33469fb51"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.12"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>12</no><heading guid="_1a8fbd83-7adc-467c-b737-55aebcdea6d3"
id="sec.12-he"><b>Delegation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Premier, the Minister for Regional New South
Wales or the Treasurer may delegate the exercise of any of their functions
under this Act (other than this power of delegation) to&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_85c05919-4b4d-42fe-9ab1-131f5e8fd9f0" id="sec.12-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the head of a Public Service agency,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2ce57ec8-5bbe-4bb3-a61a-c9d34419d91e" id="sec.12-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any other person employed in a Public Service
agency.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 12:</b> Am 2024 No 47,
Sch 1.22.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.13">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f47b951e-83bb-48d4-9ebb-d4425b57ddf6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>13</no><heading guid="_fbf96ff2-93fb-45f3-a330-0ee128818ad0"
id="sec.13-he"><b>Annual report relating to Fund</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2d6d3c64-0da5-4cc4-85f5-b2bee61f2908"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer is to publish information annually
detailing payments from the Fund in the previous year (being a year commencing
on 1 July).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.13-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eaf5ccfe-427e-4807-b6a7-ca09df651c9e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.13-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer may publish the information in any
form or manner determined by the Treasurer.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.14">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2749dcdc-2a8a-493a-9a08-b340c88e028d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.14"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>14</no><heading guid="_36bef2a7-ee25-4701-b663-c7d36418aa15"
id="sec.14-he"><b>Act to bind Crown</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act binds the Crown in right of New South
Wales and, in so far as the legislative power of the Parliament of New South
Wales permits, the Crown in all its other capacities.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.15">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cac60aca-b301-46c3-874f-fd430818d168"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.15"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>15</no><heading guid="_908f5ddd-53a6-4443-9eea-4ae49368f164"
id="sec.15-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></level>


